{"title":"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems\">2013 AMC 12B #14</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems\">2013 AMC 10B #21</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two non-decreasing sequences of nonnegative integers have different first terms. Each sequence has the property that each term beginning with the third is the sum of the previous two terms, and the seventh term of each sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. What is the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae9d50c353054a169b0a0bb3e7ebbe1f9b50287e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 55 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 89 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 104 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 144 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 273$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the first two terms of the first sequence be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/4/f742fa0e67547dbeffccff47a951855271de1348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e8655384b71dbea96222803bcc8bdfa98299216.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> and the first two of the second sequence be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1abf0353f0acd71e6406b4d342160af61fbdce49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/f/b5f0f8bc6452258649d59d7e7cd4a47d89a192d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"15\" height=\"11\" />.  Computing the seventh term, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5af0353ef4b95cada76798a4805cb5d80dc85b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x_{1} + 8x_{2} = 5y_{1} + 8y_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"172\" height=\"16\" />.  Note that this means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/4/f742fa0e67547dbeffccff47a951855271de1348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1abf0353f0acd71e6406b4d342160af61fbdce49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" /> must have the same value modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  To minimize, let one of them be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=WLOG\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"WLOG\">WLOG</a>, assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/e/07e8f230cce34c9f0411b34e9d9aa21a59f1baaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />.  Thus, the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1abf0353f0acd71e6406b4d342160af61fbdce49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; and since the sequences are non-decreasing we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4bd4d79440745537fb9bf3c6ff5a9eccb166c2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_{2} \\ge 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />.  To minimize, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/d/24d4f143934a689bb89aa4078aab5746b6ef3487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_{2} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac4e32e0c74a76597e197452622d3e6d5e488cbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5y_{1} + 8y_{2} = 40 + 64 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }104}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"256\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>WLOG, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94d9565abaadf04609a2e9941aa2d20b0a299b8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"15\" /> be the sequences with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0c38d62a96318b17a9348444743550bb49dff0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1&lt;b_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/7/6d7ed8b3d2c2ebebe407906d1949506a28576c59.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N=5a_1+8a_2=5b_1+8b_2\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b0057ea51a8c013cb8d2163ed2c25efb0a7241.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5a_1+8a_2=5(a_1+c)+8(a_2-d)\\]\" width=\"261\" height=\"18\" /> for some natural numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba2a3054298b31813cc68b62462d4928ee309e90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5c=8d$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />. To minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/4/b34d2f04f49849fce3211edf1fe31fbb2f954ddf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c,d)=(8,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a62a54ef71360b15955b138cd5904a62e4bc816.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5a_1+8a_2=5(a_1+8)+8(a_2-5).\\]\" width=\"267\" height=\"18\" /> To minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69fc4b9ed6d75d026557e7b06c2ed483c6ed0eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09d861fc1200508cccb6f57a38eea54ffc054863.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1,b_1)=(0,0+c)=(0,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"212\" height=\"18\" />. Using the same method, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/04362bbe3fcd35e0c5673d16c331ea2d314d2aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_2\\ge b_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/313bcfc209eef173b7836629c5002ba6505ec418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_2\\ge8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>Thus the minimum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c025582459ade72824d96f28ad2984ff4188dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=5b_1+8b_2= \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }104}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"211\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Do the same thing as any of the previous solutions to find the 7th term must be in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/8/ea84af3e6048a7fb325c4876568ee224f09db9b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a+8b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/e/6feb4c7109720ebec444148510acffc0e05df156.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5c+8d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/607b0e2df9b93576cc8b7f8e25b9e78a7ab66b5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\neq c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" />. Then test the options and find the smallest number that can be expressed in these 2 ways is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3d577c11c68268dfd40510367a68681964b3446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }104}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-Andrew2019\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fgQN3e_aa4Y\">https://youtu.be/fgQN3e_aa4Y</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/JF3In44sXy0\">https://youtu.be/JF3In44sXy0</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B\">2013 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Probl